        "original_id": "941194f6-ce41-58ad-8df5-af8f2227170b",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Ships: HMS Shannon, USS Chesapeake\n- People: Napoleon I, Pollard Hopewell\n- Events: Napoleonic Wars, War of 1812, battle between Chesapeake and Shannon\n- Organizations: French Empire, Great Britain, European coalitions\n\nFacts:\n- The Napoleonic Wars lasted from 1803 to 1815 and were major conflicts between the French Empire and its allies under Napoleon I and various European coalitions usually financed and led by Great Britain.\n- HMS Shannon was launched in 1806.\n- HMS Shannon served in the Napoleonic Wars and the War of 1812.\n- Pollard Hopewell was killed in the battle between the US frigate USS Chesapeake and the British frigate HMS Shannon.",
